{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2ef04412-e41a-4ece-97a7-12091ab0dd12",
    "name": "LAVO — Stations (Queue + Formats + Cron)",
    "description": "Collection pour les endpoints non couverts par lavo-stations et lavo-reservations :\n- **Stations Publiques** : join station (get maps URL)\n- **Onboarding** : upload document (multipart)\n- **Formats** : CRUD formats de vehicule (public GET + station auth PUT/PATCH/DELETE)\n- **Client — File d'attente** : rejoindre la file, voir la file, upgrade vers reservation\n- **Station — Entries** : repositionner une entree dans la file (queue_position), picker un client walk-in\n- **Cron** : sync uploads, downgrade reservations tardives, rappels reservation (5h et 30min)\n\nNOTE : Liste des stations et detail → lavo-stations (Stations Publiques)\nNOTE : Creation reservation, consultation, annulation, confirmation presence → lavo-reservations\n\nRequired: base_url. Optional: station_id, format_id, entry_id, queue_entry_id, time_slot_id, access_token, cron_secret.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "station_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cron_secret",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "format_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "entry_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "time_slot_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "queue_entry_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Stations Publiques",
      "description": "Endpoints publics supplementaires. Pour la liste et le detail des stations, voir lavo-stations (groupe Stations Publiques).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Join station — get maps URL (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('mapsUrl present', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('mapsUrl');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.mapsUrl).to.match(/^https:\\/\\/www\\.google\\.com\\/maps\\?q=/);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/stations/{{station_id}}/join",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "stations",
                "{{station_id}}",
                "join"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/v1/stations/:id/join — retourne un lien Google Maps vers la station."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Onboarding",
      "description": "Upload uniquement. Pour validate/step1, validate/step2 et submit, voir lavo-stations (groupe Station Onboarding).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload document (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Body has url and storage', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('url');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('storage');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/stations/onboarding/upload",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "stations",
                "onboarding",
                "upload"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/v1/stations/onboarding/upload — multipart/form-data, champ 'file'. Sans auth. Retourne 201 avec { data: { url, storage } }. Utilisez url dans le body de submit (documents[].file_url)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
